he's fine, he's not hurt.

00:03:50.510 --> 00:03:52.790
And uh, well this is weird.

00:03:52.790 --> 00:03:53.940
He hasn't shown up yet.

00:03:54.900 --> 00:03:55.740
I'm a little worried now,

00:03:55.740 --> 00:03:58.430
I think something must
have happened this time.

00:03:58.430 --> 00:04:00.333
Something did happen, Conan.

00:04:00.333 --> 00:04:01.380
(audience laughing)

00:04:01.380 --> 00:04:02.753
Something very bad.

00:04:03.590 --> 00:04:06.423
Hi, I'm Dr. Ron Werling, with KAEMS.

00:04:07.590 --> 00:04:08.870
KAEMS?

00:04:08.870 --> 00:04:13.200
