00:04:15.930 --> 00:04:16.763
That's horrible.

00:04:16.763 --> 00:04:17.730
(audience laughing)

00:04:17.730 --> 00:04:20.246
Yes, yes, he will be missed.

00:04:20.246 --> 00:04:22.778
No, no, no, no, no, your
costume is horrible.

00:04:22.778 --> 00:04:24.290
(audience laughing)

00:04:24.290 --> 00:04:26.000
