you didn't fool anybody.

00:04:29.060 --> 00:04:30.550
I didn't fool anybody?!

00:04:30.550 --> 00:04:33.978
That's ridiculous,
there's no reason to live!

00:04:33.978 --> 00:04:34.858
(audience laughing)

00:04:34.858 --> 00:04:36.887
Where's my skateboard?

00:04:36.887 --> 00:04:38.270
Where's my skateboard?

00:04:38.270 --> 00:04:40.712
(audience cheering)

00:04:40.712 --> 00:04:42.141
Come on!

00:04:42.141 --> 00:04:43.683
(audience laughing)

00:04:43.683 --> 00:04:46.850
