00:06:23.310 --> 00:06:27.037
And I'm a total idiot, and
there's no reason to live, man!

00:06:27.037 --> 00:06:28.372
Where's my kayak?

00:06:28.372 --> 00:06:30.381
(audience cheering)

00:06:30.381 --> 00:06:31.230
Gotta go!

00:06:31.230 --> 00:06:33.797
(audience cheering)

00:06:33.797 --> 00:06:35.964
There's no reason to live!

00:06:37.137 --> 00:06:38.829
